{"id":640,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"知徳体と自主性を育む青雲の六年一貫教育","feature_description":"青雲学園は六カ年一貫教育の中で知・徳・体の調和を図り、独自のカリキュラムで効率的に学びながら高度な知識と学力を育てます。青雲中学校では体験活動やボランティア、読書などを取り入れ、教科の基礎学力と考える力・応用力を伸ばします。寮生活では節度ある行動や責任を重視し、教師・生徒・保護者が六年間を見通して成長を支えます。中学では柔道・剣道を必修とし、礼儀作法も学びます。","clubs":[{"id":11811,"name":"プログラミング同好会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11812,"name":"創造ものつくり同好会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14521,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14522,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14523,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14524,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14525,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14526,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14527,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14528,"name":"バトミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14529,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14530,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14531,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://seiun-jh.ed.jp/campuslife/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14